 "text": "Hi, how's everything with you? If you eat out a lot, it saves money on shopping for ingredients. A fully stocked fridge means fewer fast food and takeaway trips. Most kitchens come standard with a quiet door that can be swapped for a quieter one for a small fee. Ask at least a day after checking availability. Then treat her to show her own space and ingredients. She'd love it, I guarantee it. Roughly two months from ground breaking to moving in, though there are always outliers.",
